## 2. Approved model path for character consistency (verified against official docs + pricing, fetched 2026-09-22)

Source URLs: docs.dev.runwayml.com `/guides/models.md`, `/guides/pricing.md`, `/api.md`, `/ai-context.md` (all fetched live this run). Credits: **$0.01/credit** (official pricing page).

### Step 1 — Character anchor keyframe (photos and pre-video)
`gemini_image3_pro` (Nano Banana Pro) on `POST /v1/text_to_image` — the roster's strongest character-consistency image path with a **published price**: up to 14 references with up to 5 explicit `subject: "human"` (dedicated human-identity mode), tag-referenced, prompt ≤5500 chars, `outputCount` 1 (keep at 1; 4 would bill 4×).
- Ratio: `896:1152` (≈4:5, closest published 1K tier to the AAR-14 house 928×1152) or `832:1248` (2:3); 2K/4K tiers available at published prices.
- Price: **20 credits ($0.20) per 1K or 2K image**, 40 credits 4K.
- Budget candidates pending AAR-26 brief QC (published prices, no explicit human-subject flag): `gen4_image` 5 cr/720p-class, 8 cr/1080p (≤3 tagged refs); `muse_image` 1 cr (≤10 loose refs); `gen4_image_turbo` 2 cr (refs **required**). `gemini_image3.1_flash` is excluded from costed plans: its price is **not published** in the official pricing table.
- Excluded by the clean-image standard's zero-text gate regardless of model: the AAR-14 negative block is folded into prompt text (see §5 Gate A).

### Step 2 — Character video (5 s, 9:16 class)
`gen4.5` on `POST /v1/image_to_video`, driving from the **approved anchor still as first frame** (`promptImage.position: "first"`) — the strongest published-price character-lock video path on the current roster (Gen-4.5 is Runway's flagship; 720:1280 is a valid ratio; duration 5 is valid, 2–10 integer; promptText ≤1000 chars, required).
- Price: **12 credits/s → 60 credits ($0.60) per 5 s at 720:1280**. No audio flag is documented for gen4.5 (audio bundled in the flat rate; PNG-sequence delivery notes a separate .wav when output has audio); Aarohi VO/music is composited downstream per the AAR-11 reel standard regardless.
- No `negativePrompt` field on gen4.5 → negative clauses are written into the positive prompt.
- Contingency when identity/wardrobe drift recurs: `seedance2_5` image-to-video (reference-image mode; `audio` param, refs free; 720p **30 cr/s → 160 cr ($1.60) per 5 s**; promptText ≤15000; ratio 720:1280 valid) — priced verbatim at request time before any gate.
- Budget alternative (durations limited to 4/6/8 s): `veo3.1_fast` no-audio 10 cr/s (50 cr/5 s), supports `negativePrompt`; audio variant 15 cr/s.
- Prohibited: `gen3a_turbo` and `gen4_aleph` (retired — hard-fail per official ai-context), and any identifier not on the 2026-09-22 roster. Model Router stays out of scope (AAR-22 surface decision).

